flowchart TD
    A([python agent.py start]) --> B[Load .env]
    B --> C{SSL_VERIFY=false?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Patch ssl / httpx / aiohttp]
    C -- No --> E[Normal SSL]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Import LiveKit Agents]
    F --> G{Import success?}
    G -- No --> H[Log warning\n_LIVEKIT_AVAILABLE = False]
    G -- Yes --> I[Register entrypoint function]
    I --> J[cli.run_app with WorkerOptions]
    J --> K[LiveKit Worker starts\nListens for room connections]